# Two "Players can't gain life" statics (CR 119.7): Bot1 controls Sunspine Lynx and Giant Cindermaw. On turn 2 Bot2's Swords to
# Plowshares exiles the Lynx, and "its controller gains life equal to its power" gains Bot1 nothing: the Cindermaw still says
# players can't. A second Swords exiles the Cindermaw, and with neither left Bot1 gains its 4. Every land is basic, so the Lynx's
# enters ability deals no damage.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Ruby
Sunspine Lynx
Giant Cindermaw
Mountain
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Mountain x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Plains
Mox Pearl
Swords to Plowshares
Swords to Plowshares
Island
Island
Island
Island x20

